      <data key="d8">Measured UBE values for OVC-HEVs</data>
      <data key="d24">[TABLE:GTR22.ANNEX-3.3.1.1.TABLE-U1] [EQ:GTR22.ANNEX-3.3.1.1.EQ-1] Parameters Explanation The required input parameter UBEmeasured,nc is calculated as follows: [EQ:GTR22.ANNEX-3.3.1.1.EQ-2] [EQ:GTR22.ANNEX-3.3.1.1.EQ-3] [EQ:GTR22.ANNEX-3.3.1.1.EQ-4] is the conversion factor from Ws to Wh. The required input parameter ∆E_REESS,CC,ave is calculated as follows: [EQ:GTR22.ANNEX-3.3.1.1.EQ-5] [EQ:GTR22.ANNEX-3.3.1.1.EQ-6] Parameters Explanation t_start,CC is the time at the beginning of the confirmation cycle of the chargedepleting test, s; tend,CC is the time at the end of the confirmation cycle of the chargedepleting test, s; [EQ:GTR22.ANNEX-3.3.1.1.EQ-7] is the conversion factor from Ws to Wh. CC means confirmation cycle as defined in GTR15 Annex 8, paragraph</data>
