      <data key="d51">Parameters Explanation Rangemeasured Rangemeasured is the measured equivalent all-electric range as defined in the equation below: EAER_measured= ( M_CO2,CS − M_CO2,CD,avg MCO2,CS ) × R_cdc where: MCO2,CD,avg is the arithmetic average charge-depleting CO2 mass emission according to GTR15, Annex 8, Paragraph 4.4.4.1., g/km; MCO2,CS is the charge-sustaining CO2 mass emission according to GTR15, Annex 8, Table A8/5 Step no. 5, g/km; RCDC is the measured length of the charge-depleting test according to GTR15, Annex 8, Table A8/8, Step no. 3, km; No rounding shall be applied on Rangemeasured.</data>
